      "description": "You choose a creature you can see within range veil them with a protective aura to protect them and creatures around them from one of the following damage types: bludgeoning, cold, fire, lightning, necrotic, radiant or thunder. The creature and allied creature within a 20ft. radius of the creature gain resistance to the selected damage type. When they are targeted with an attack that deals that kind of damage the attack is made with disadvantage, and any saving throws they make against spells that deal that kind of damage is made with advantage. Any damage they take of the chosen damage type is reduced by your spell casting abilitiy modifier.",
