      "areaOfEffectType": "",
      "areaOfEffectSize": "",
      "statusEffects": "",
      "description": "You use forbidden magicks to ravage the a creature’s body and soul you can see within range. The creature must succeed on a Charisma saving throw or take 40d10 force damage or half as much on a successful save. If this damage reduces the target to 0 hit points, the creature dies and its soul is destroyed and cannot be restored by any means except by a W ish spell.",
